Description: Local Shiny application that infers ECM-ECM and cell-ECM
    communication systems from single-cell RNA-seq data using MatriComDB, a
    curated database of matrisome interactions. Accepts Seurat,
    SingleCellExperiment, qs2 and h5ad files with no upload size limit.
